WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:33.272
The system understood a date. Did the query change?

00:00:33.272 --> 00:01:10.287
Make the generated expression visible

00:01:10.287 --> 00:01:48.073
Two Primo features are different workflows

00:01:48.073 --> 00:02:21.939
A later query can depend on earlier results

00:02:21.939 --> 00:02:51.254
Reordering a screening pool is a different operation

00:02:51.254 --> 00:03:25.723
The query can adapt while the sequence stays fixed

00:03:25.723 --> 00:04:00.965
An added term can be a weight or rewritten text

00:04:00.965 --> 00:04:38.667
Record what changed, when, and where it went
